sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Hub
    participant A as Agent
    participant S as Creator site
    participant C as Gateway

    rect rgb(232, 242, 255)
    Note over A,S: PHASE 1 · DISCOVERY & EVALUATION (read-only, free)
    A->>H: GET /.well-known/llms.txt
    H-->>A: Curated index + endpoint map
    A->>H: GET /api/hub/explore/content
    H-->>A: Content cards
    A->>S: GET /nibgate.json
    S-->>A: Metadata, price, access policy
    end

    rect rgb(232, 255, 235)
    Note over A,C: PHASE 2 · X402 PURCHASE (one retried round trip)
    A->>S: GET /api/nibgate/access?path=...
    S-->>A: 402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED (base64 x402)
    Note over A: Sign EIP-3009 authorization<br/>(gasless, off-chain)
    A->>S: Retry + PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header
    S->>C: Verify + settle authorization
    C-->>S: Settlement receipt (txHash)
    S-->>A: 200 + content + unlockProof + payment
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 230)
    Note over A,H: PHASE 3 · ON-CHAIN RATING (post-purchase)
    A->>H: POST /api/hub/reputation/ratings/prepare
    H-->>A: Signable message + contentHash
    Note over A: Sign rateContent calldata
    A->>H: POST /api/hub/reputation/ratings/index
    H-->>A: Rating indexed, reputation updated
    end
